WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.120
Most roadmaps start everyone at step one.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.720
Tell Asta what you want to learn,
and how much time you have.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.410
Rate yourself, then take a short check,
so we know where you really stand.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.550
Anbu builds your plan around the gap.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.060
What you already know, you skip.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.280
Skip what you know. Learn what you don't.
